From: ra <ra@sm.sony.co.jp>

if beecrypt library is not existed, configure will exit. As beecrypt
is no needed to compile popt, This patch is used to continue
configure.
---
 configure
 1 files changed

Index: rpm-4.4.2.1/configure
===================================================================
--- rpm-4.4.2.1.orig/configure
+++ rpm-4.4.2.1/configure
@@ -26523,8 +26523,7 @@ _ACEOF
 
    if test -z "${WITH_BEECRYPT_LIB}" ; then
        { { echo "$as_me:$LINENO: error: rpm requires beecrypt" >&5
-echo "$as_me: error: rpm requires beecrypt" >&2;}
-   { (exit 1); exit 1; }; }
+echo "$as_me: error: rpm requires beecrypt" >&2;} }
    fi
 
 fi
